h\">ええ、わたしも そう <ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いますが、･････。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Vâng, tôi cũng nghĩ thế nhưng mà….</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">あ、もう <ruby>帰<rp>(</rp><rt>かえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らないと、･････。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Ái chà, đã tới lúc phải về rồi,….</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span><ruby>松本<rp>(</rp><rt>まつもと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>： </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">ええ、<ruby>帰<rp>(</rp><rt>かえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りましょう。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Vâng, về thôi.</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table>"
